{
  "title": "Aromatic Dense Uruguayan Provola Wrap",
  "description": "A dense and aromatic Uruguayan dish featuring provola, perfect for a post-workout meal, wrapped in a lotus leaf for a unique twist.",
  "cuisine": "Uruguayan",
